  "details": "After Sipp switched avatars and disabled FBT, a clone and loading avatar got stuck for all remote players. \nIt also displayed for remote users that had the avatar hidden beforehand.\n\nEach time avatar was reset, another clone was made. \nCould not replicate after they rejoined the world.\n\nLogs:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/906300602982756352/951717087678697502/output_log_20-27-15.txt\n\nFirst error occurred at \"2022.03.10 22:56:51\", line 68997 in log file.",
